  isTimeAttack: 0
  timeAttackDuration: 60
  winCondition: 0
  requiredIntactTime: 5
  goldReward: 500
  expReward: 100
  offerDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences:
    - Now that you understand bending, let's put that knowledge to use.
    - We need a bridge that can connect the factory to Central Canyonville.
    - The crossing is <b><#E09500>60 meters</color></b> wide.
    - A pickup truck will use this route during the test.
    - Your job is to construct a bridge that can safely carry the pickup across.
    - Remember what we discussed about bending.
    - <b><#E09500>Pay attention to how the bridge responds under the vehicle's weight</color></b>.
    - <b><#E09500>Watch the structure closely when you run the test</color></b>.
    - If you're ready, I've got the contract.
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences:
    - The crossing's yours, {PlayerName}.
    - Remember what we discussed about bending.
    - Keep an eye on how the bridge responds when you run the test.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Reed
    sentences:
    - That's exactly what the crossing needed.
    - The factory finally has a direct connection to Central Canyonville.
    - Getting supplies into the city should be much easier now.
    - You handled your first project out here well.
    - And now you've seen how bending affects a bridge under load.
    - Nice work, {PlayerName}.
    - I'm sure we'll meet again some other time.
